        "product_summary": "Panelled casual upper: Curved stitched overlays, a contrasting side insert and small visible perforations define the utility-inspired profile.\n\nAdjustable lace front: Lace guides across the tongue let the buyer adjust the fastening at the instep.\n\nSculpted PVC sole: The supplier identifies the sole as PVC. Raised sidewall sections and a contrast heel accent give the shoe a pronounced casual outline.\n\nRear pull loop: A low-top collar and rear loop provide a place to grip the shoe when putting it on.\n\nAssortment planning: Black and Brown are currently listed in EU38-45. Send colour-size quantities, packing preference and destination for a wholesale quotation.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
